style brands uniting the magic of Coach and kate spade new york. Together, we stretch what's possible – advancing brands further than they could go alone, expanding their reach to new geographies and generations. Inspired by our consumers, we create experiences and products that build lasting brand love and elevate everyday life.","zh":"Tapestry, Inc.（以下簡稱「公司」）是一家全球標誌性配件和生活風格品牌公司，融合了 Coach 和 kate spade new york 的魔力。我們齊心協力，盡一切可能，將品牌推向比單打獨鬥更遠的水平，將其影響力擴展到新的地區和世代。受到消費者的啟發，我們創造體驗和產品，建立持久的品牌熱愛並提升日​​常生活。"},{"en":"Coach - Coach is a global fashion house of accessories and lifestyle collections, founded in New York City in 1941. Inspired by the vision of Expressive Luxury and the inclusive and courageous spirit of its hometown, the brand makes beautiful things, crafted to last – for you to be yourself in. Coach has built a legacy of craftsmanship and a community that champions the courage to be real. Coach includes global sales of primarily Coach brand products to customers through our direct-to-consumer (\"DTC\"), wholesale and licensing businesses. This segment represented 86.4% of total net sales in fiscal 2026.","zh":"Coach - Coach 是一家全球時裝品牌，主打配件和生活方式系列，於 1941 年在紐約成立。受到表現力奢華的願景以及家鄉包容和勇敢的精神的啟發，該品牌製造精美的產品，經久耐用，讓您做回自己。 Coach 建立了精湛的工藝傳統，並建立了一個勇於面對現實的社群。 Coach 包括透過我們的直接面向消費者（「DTC」）、批發和授權業務向客戶主要銷售 Coach 品牌產品的全球銷售。該細分市場佔 2026 財年總淨銷售額的 86.4%。"},{"en":"Kate Spade - Since its launch in 1993 with a collection of six essential handbags, kate spade new york has always been feminine, colorful, and optimistic. Today, it is a global lifestyle brand that designs extraordinary things for the everyday, delivering seasonal collections of handbags, ready-to-wear, jewelry, footwear, gifts, home d cor and more. Known for its rich heritage and unique brand DNA, kate spade new york's mission is to be the world's most welcoming and uplifting fashion brand. Where a touch of wit and intentional color can inspire you to find joy in the everyday. Kate Spade includes global sales of primarily kate spade new york brand products to customers through our DTC, wholesale and licensing businesses. This segment represented 13.4% of total net sales in fiscal 2026.","zh":"Kate Spade - 自 1993 年推出六款必備手袋以來，kate spade new york 始終充滿女性魅力、色彩繽紛且樂觀向上。如今，它已成為一個全球生活方式品牌，為日常生活設計非凡的產品，提供季節性系列的手袋、成衣、珠寶、鞋類、禮品、家居裝飾等。 kate spade new york 以其豐富的傳統和獨特的品牌 DNA 而聞名，其使命是成為世界上最受歡迎和令人振奮的時尚品牌。一點點智慧和有意的色彩可以激發您在日常生活中找到樂趣。 Kate Spade 主要透過 DTC、批發和授權業務向客戶銷售 kate spade new york 品牌產品。該部門佔 2026 財年總淨銷售額的 13.4%。"}],"markets":[{"en":"(1)All Stuart Weitzman net sales are included within the Tapestry Footwear category. For the year ended June 27, 2026, Stuart Weitzman net sales were for the period prior to the sale on August 4, 2025. Refer to Note 5, \"Acquisitions and Divestitures,\" for further information.","zh":"(1)Stuart Weitzman 的所有淨銷售額均包含在 Tapestry Footwear 類別中。截至 2026 年 6 月 27 日的年度，Stuart Weitzman 的淨銷售額為 2025 年 8 月 4 日出售之前的期間。請參閱附註 5「收購與剝離」以了解更多資訊。"},{"en":"Handbags — This category primarily includes handbags classically inspired as well as fashion designs, business cases, computer bags, messenger-style bags, backpacks, and totes.","zh":"手袋 — 此類別主要包括經典風格的手袋以及時尚設計、商務包、電腦包、斜背包、背包和手提包。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Coach - Coach is a global fashion house of accessories and lifestyle collections, founded in New York City in 1941. Inspired by the vision of Expressive Luxury and the inclusive and courageous spirit of its hometown, the brand makes beautiful things, crafted to last – for you to be yourself in. Coach has built a legacy of craftsmanship and a community that champions the courage to be real. Coach includes global sales of primarily Coach brand products to customers through our direct-to-consumer (\"DTC\"), wholesale and licensing businesses. This segment represented 86.4% of total net sales in fiscal 2026.","zh":"Coach - Coach 是一家全球時裝品牌，主打配件和生活方式系列，於 1941 年在紐約成立。受到表現力奢華的願景以及家鄉包容和勇敢的精神的啟發，該品牌製造精美的產品，經久耐用，讓您做回自己。 Coach 建立了精湛的工藝傳統，並建立了一個勇於面對現實的社群。 Coach 包括透過我們的直接面向消費者（「DTC」）、批發和授權業務向客戶主要銷售 Coach 品牌產品的全球銷售。該細分市場佔 2026 財年總淨銷售額的 86.4%。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The Company faces intense competition from many other brands in the product lines and markets that we participate. In varying degrees, depending on the product category involved, we compete on the basis of style, price, customer service, quality, brand prestige and recognition, among others. Over the last decade, these brands have grown and are expected to continue to grow, encouraging the entry of new competitors as well as increasing the competition from existing competitors. This increased competition drives interest in these brand loyal categories. We believe, however, that we have significant competitive advantages because of the recognition and the acceptance of our brands by consumers and the power of our information technology platform.","zh":"在我們參與的產品線和市場中，公司面臨許多其他品牌的激烈競爭。根據所涉及的產品類別，我們在不同程度上在款式、價格、客戶服務、品質、品牌信譽和認可度等方面競爭。在過去十年中，這些品牌已經發展並預計將繼續發展，鼓勵新競爭對手的進入，並加劇現有競爭對手的競爭。競爭的加劇激發了人們對這些品牌忠誠類別的興趣。然而，我們相信，由於消費者對我們品牌的認可和接受以及我們資訊科技平台的力量，我們擁有顯著的競爭優勢。"},{"en":"As a people-centered and purpose-led Company, Tapestry believes that a better-made future is one that is both beautiful and responsible. Our Corporate Responsibility (\"CR\") strategy, the Fabric of Change, aims to unite teams across the Company's business to achieve our Corporate Responsibility Goals and a shared objective: to create a company of the future that balances true fashion authority with meaningful, positive change. The Fabric of Change focuses on four pillars: Power of Our People, Sustain the Planet, Uplift Our Communities and Create Products with Care.","zh":"作為一家以人為本、以目標為導向的公司，Tapestry 相信美好的未來是美好的，也是負責任的。我們的企業責任（“CR”）策略，即“變革的結構”，旨在團結公司各個業務部門的團隊，以實現我們的企業責任目標和共同目標：創建一家未來的公司，在真正的時尚權威與有意義的積極變革之間取得平衡。改變的結構專注於四大支柱：我們人民的力量、維持地球、提升我們的社區以及精心創造產品。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-06-27","items":[{"name":"Coach","val":6914700000,"zh":"教練"},{"name":"Kate Spade Company","val":1074900000,"zh":"凱特絲蓓公司"},{"name":"Stuart Weitzman","val":14600000,"zh":"斯圖爾特·韋茨曼"},{"name":"Stuart Weitzman","val":14600000,"zh":"斯圖爾特韋茨曼段"}],"total":8004200000},"prod":{"end":"2026-06-27","items":[{"name":"Handbags","val":4611200000,"zh":"手袋"},{"name":"Accessories","val":2232900000,"zh":"配件"},{"name":"Other","val":688900000,"zh":"其他"},{"name":"Footwear","val":471200000,"zh":"鞋類"}],"total":8004200000},"geo":{"end":"2026-06-27","items":[{"name":"North America","val":5043500000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"US","val":4697400000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":1442400000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"Greater China","val":1398700000,"zh":"大中華區"},{"name":"CN","val":1398700000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"Other Asia","val":907300000,"zh":"其他亞洲地區"},{"name":"Non Us","val":654700000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"JP","val":465700000,"zh":"日本"}],"total":8004200000}},"peers":["CPRI","PVH","RL","LKQ","ROST"]}}